    <briefdescription>
<para>Base interface for metadata tables that support time travel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans of these tables accept <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1MetadataScanBuilder_1adfe1e25698db4ec6d93b983db5ef723d" kindref="member">MetadataScanBuilder::UseSnapshot()</ref>, UseRef(), and AsOfTime(), which <ref refid="classiceberg_1_1MetadataScanBuilder_1a74e02810bf8f480cacb93e1821b71c90" kindref="member">MetadataScanBuilder::Build()</ref> rejects for other tables. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
